cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Ball possession from tracking: More than a Hack 2027, Phase 1"
message: "If you use this code, please cite it."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Frame-level ball possession (home, away or dead ball) for the More than a Hack 2027 Phase 1
  challenge, from the organisers' tracking and Smart Tagging only. Stage 1 finds dead-ball
  frames from football rules read off the tracking and a learned detector; stage 2 decides which
  team has the ball from the shape of the two teams. Both learned parts are trained on the DFL
  open data (Bassek et al. 2025, CC BY 4.0).
authors:
  - name: "bar_celona"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - football
  - soccer
  - ball possession
  - tracking data
  - sports analytics
